        <h1>Test Any Regex, <em>Nothing Uploaded</em></h1>
        <p class="dek">A practical guide to regular expressions: the building blocks, why a pattern that works in Python can break in JavaScript, how a single careless regex can freeze a whole application, and why the test strings you paste are safest on your own device. The Best Answer Hub Regex Tester matches and replaces in your browser and sends nothing to a server.</p>
