        <h2>Sources</h2>
        <ul class="sources">
          <li>MDN Web Docs, <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Guide/Regular_expressions" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Regular expressions guide</a>, 2025 (character classes, quantifiers, anchors, groups, and the g, i, m, and s flags).</li>
