          <li>Federal Trade Commission, <a href="https://www.ftc.gov/business-guidance/resources/protecting-personal-information-guide-business" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Protecting Personal Information: A Guide for Business</a>, 2026 (do not collect sensitive information you do not need).</li>
          <li>MDN Web Docs, <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn_web_development/Core/Scripting/What_is_JavaScript" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">What is JavaScript?</a>, 2025 (client-side code runs on the user's own computer).</li>
          <li>IETF, <a href="https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5322" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">RFC 5322, Internet Message Format</a>, 2008 (the email address grammar behind why a fully compliant email regex is impractical).</li>
